item.description:
Exchange a refresh token for a new access + refresh pair. The old refresh token is revoked (rotation); reusing a revoked token revokes ALL tokens for that user.

Errors: 401 {"message": {"message": "Invalid or expired refresh token" | "Invalid token type" | "Malformed token" | "Token not found" | "Token has been revoked"}}
Missing refresh_token -> 417 FrappeTypeError.

Return the current user's info from the Bearer token — no session cookie required.

Success 200: {"message": {"user": "...", "full_name": "...", "roles": [...]}}
Errors: 401 missing/invalid token.
